From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tom <tompt@seznam.cz>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:57:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] soc: apple: admit T8011 speaker DMA endpoint

The J120 MCA2 describes SmartIO transmit endpoint 0x2c. Admit it alongside the existing headphone and microphone endpoints.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/soc/apple/apple-sio-core.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/soc/apple/apple-sio-core.c b/drivers/soc/apple/apple-sio-core.c
index b7a968293..f4caefda8 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/apple/apple-sio-core.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/apple/apple-sio-core.c
@@ -1187,8 +1187,9 @@ static const struct apple_sio_hw apple_sio_t7000_hw = {
 	.num_dma_ranges = ARRAY_SIZE(apple_sio_t7000_dma_ranges),
 };
 
-/* J120 MCA4 transmit and PDM receive. */
+/* J120 ADT: MCA2 speaker TX, MCA4 headphone TX and PDM microphone RX. */
 static const struct apple_sio_dma_range apple_sio_t8011_dma_ranges[] = {
+	{ 0x2c, 0x2c },
 	{ 0x30, 0x30 },
 	{ 0x5b, 0x5b },
 };
